    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃剩的東西、吃剩的東西，\n取得有點不怎麼樣的名字！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5403526976846771897F30015403526976846771897FFF0C000A53D65F9767099EDE4E0D600E9EBC6A237684540D5B57FF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃剩的東西、吃剩的東西，\n非常有用的好東西♪<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5403526976846771897F30015403526976846771897FFF0C000A975E5E38670975287684597D6771897F266A001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃剩的東西、吃剩的東西，\n說不定是寶可夢都很喜歡的東西？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5403526976846771897F30015403526976846771897FFF0C000A8AAA4E0D5B9A662F5BF653EF592290FD5F88559C6B6176846771897FFF1F001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是個認真的服務生。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n為了防止食物浪費，\n我要告訴<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳吃剩的東西有多麼有用！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F500B8A8D771F7684670D52D9751F300200100001BE01000A70BA4E8696326B6298DF72696D6A8CBBFF0C000A62118981544A8A3400100003110000FF01014F6059B35403526976846771897F6709591A9EBC67097528FF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不小心向我搭話的這位客人！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n來和身上攜帶了吃剩的東西的\n寶可夢們一決勝負吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D5C0F5FC354116211642D8A71768490194F4D5BA24EBAFF0100100001BE01000A4F86548C8EAB4E0A651C5E364E865403526976846771897F7684000A5BF653EF592250114E006C7A52DD8CA05427FF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好要和我們一決勝負的話，\n就跟我搭話吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D8981548C621150114E006C7A52DD8CA076848A71FF0C000A5C318DDF6211642D8A715427FF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意和身上攜帶了吃剩的東西的\n寶可夢們一決勝負嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F548C8EAB4E0A651C5E364E865403526976846771897F7684000A5BF653EF592250114E006C7A52DD8CA055CEFF1F001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一決勝負吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E006C7A52DD8CA05427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃剩的東西有多厲害，\n得要對戰體驗才明白。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5403526976846771897F6709591A53B25BB3FF0C000A5F9789815C0D62309AD49A57624D660E767D3002001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "即使我的寶可夢們在對戰中\n嚼啊嚼地吃東西，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也別計較，就當是牠們的萌點吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53734F7F621176845BF653EF5922501157285C0D62304E2D000A56BC554A56BC573054036771897FFF0C00100001BE00000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F52258A088F03FF0C5C317576662F726050117684840C9EDE5427FF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算帶上了吃剩的東西，\n會輸的時候還是會輸呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B975E364E0A4E865403526976846771897FFF0C000A67038F387684664250199084662F67038F385462FF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然這麼說很奇怪，\n但這個新的「吃剩的東西」就送給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713690199EBC8AAA5F885947602AFF0C000A4F469019500B65B07684300C5403526976846771897F300D5C3190017D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B356C9FF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要寶可夢攜帶著吃剩的東西，\n每隔一段時間牠的HP就會回復！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就算是在對戰中也會嚼呀嚼地吃東西，\n那樣實在很可愛對吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA89815BF653EF5922651C5E3684575403526976846771897FFF0C000A6BCF96944E006BB56642959372607684004800505C31670356DE5FA9FF0100100001BE01000A5C317B97662F57285C0D62304E2D4E5F670356BC544056BC573054036771897FFF0C000A90A36A235BE657285F8853EF611B5C0D5427FF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！\n我這下發現了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF01000A621190194E0B767C73FE4E8620262026001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃剩的東西竟然吃都吃不完？\n難道是可以永遠一直吃？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n這算是寶可夢界的七大不可思議吧？\n雖然我不知道剩下六個是什麼啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
